---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Cat from '../components/Cat.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import {enquiryUrl} from '../data/site.mjs';
---
<Base title="The human behind the paws" description="Meet CappyTheDev, an independent freelancer in Miri, Sarawak helping small businesses and job seekers with websites, resumes and food visuals.">
  <section class="about-page-hero wrap"><a class="text-link" href="/">← Back to the little studio</a><div class="about-page-grid"><div><span class="section-kicker">A little introduction</span><h1>One human.<br/>Many ideas.<br/><span class="coral-text">Big cat energy.</span></h1><p>I’m Cappy, an independent freelancer in Miri, Sarawak. I make useful, good-looking things for people taking their next step.</p><a class="button button-dark" href={enquiryUrl()} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Say hello <Icon name="diagonal"/></a></div><div class="about-page-cat"><Cat variant="developer"/><span class="hand-note">usually making something ↖</span></div></div></section>
  <section class="about-story wrap"><h2>Good design should<br/>feel approachable.</h2><div><p>You don’t need a huge business or a perfect brief to get started. Sometimes you just need a website that explains what you do, a resume that tells your story clearly, or food photos that give your cooking the attention it deserves.</p><p>That’s where I come in. You’ll work directly with me. We’ll keep the scope clear, the conversation friendly, and the details thoughtful.</p><p>The cats? A little reminder that professional work can still have personality.</p><a class="text-link" href="/#pricing">Find your starting point <Icon name="arrow"/></a></div></section>
  <section class="about-full-art wrap"><img src="/artwork/about.webp" alt="The studio's cat-themed about-me poster featuring Miri, Sarawak, website design, resume services and food visuals" width="1200" height="800" loading="lazy"/></section>
</Base>
